# Push (AppView → Nest) Configuration
# AppView mints an ES256 service JWT to trigger generic circle_activity pushes
# on Nest. When any push variable below is set, the whole set must be complete
# or AppView fails startup (fail-closed). The signing key is provided either
# as a P-256 private key file (PUSH_SIGNING_KEY_PATH) or as raw hex bytes
# (PUSH_SIGNING_KEY_HEX); provide exactly one.
# NEST_PUSH_URL=https://nest.catbird.blue/internal/circle/push
# NEST_PUSH_AUDIENCE=https://api.catbird.blue
# NEST_PUSH_SERVICE_DID=did:web:push.catbird.blue
# PUSH_KEY_ID=did:web:circles.catbird.blue#atproto_circle
# PUSH_SIGNING_KEY_PATH=/path/to/p256_private.pem
# PUSH_SIGNING_KEY_HEX=0123456789abcdef...
